    <summary>Privacy-focused browser developed by Mullvad VPN and the Tor Project</summary>
    <description>Mullvad Browser is a privacy-focused browser developed together with the Tor Project.
It is designed to minimize tracking and browser fingerprinting — essentially Tor Browser without the Tor Network, for use with (or without) a trustworthy VPN.

### Features

- Blocks third-party trackers with uBlock Origin
- Resists fingerprinting (letterboxing and related techniques)
- Private browsing mode enabled by default; no cookies saved between sessions
- No telemetry
- Open source and free of charge

![Screenshot](https://cdn.statically.io/gh/Aurocosh/chocolatey-packages/master/automatic/mullvad-browser/img/screenshot.png)
</description>
